            "review_title": "Review at Phui Quan",
            "review_text": "Erica M\nAdelaide, Australia340 contributions\n0\nVietnamese delight\nSep 2017 • Friends\nWe were with friends looking for somewhere to eat when we decided to try this restaurant . There were no foreigners in there but the waiting staff had enough English so it was easy to order . The menu was in English and Vietnamese . We had beers ( Hanoi beer ) and ordered three dishes and rice , all of which were delicious . This restaurant is authentic and so is the food . The beef wrapped around lemon grass was very good as were the other dishes . We actually ended up going there twice .\nRead more\nReview collected in partnership with this restaurant \nWritten September 9, 2017",
